# motion-open (plan section 6, M12; SM · Motion › Opening and Closing): the panel comes out of the
# gear on the enter spring at its own pace (643 ms: in place by 200, 5 % over at 270) from 90 %
# about its top right corner and 8 px up, fading in linearly over 160 ms; every frame to 320 ms,
# then every 80 to 640. Esc then sends it back the same way, linearly, in 200 ms, inert as it goes;
# the gear loses its open border at once.
# Positions at 1440 x 900 from the reference's DOM with the panel open (tools/run dom): the gear
# (1363, 28, 40 x 40), the panel (1099, 76, 304 x 256); the Appearance toggle's options 91.33 x 34
# from (1113, 112) (System, Light, Dark: centres 1159, 1251, 1343 at y 129); the theme rows 278 x 36
# from (1112, 211), 36 apart (centres at y 229, 265, 301); the help line (1112, 155, 278 x 18); the
# gap between the two settings y 173 to 189. The panel's opening runs 643 ms, so a shot of it at
# rest waits 700.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 1383 48
frames opening every 16 for 320
wait 80
frames opening-late every 80 for 240
wait 80
key Escape
frames closing every 16 for 208
